    rf"--deal {INSTANT} {WHOSE}{AGAIN}; then change only the task's files, and run: hive\.py submit --project Bee-ruche/toy "
    rf"--task toy-[0-9]{{4}} --deal {INSTANT} {WHOSE} --message \"<one line: what you changed>\"",
